MnM — Make no Mistake
Authors and contributors

This file lists individuals who have contributed code, documentation, or
design to the MnM project. It is maintained manually and complements the
git history (the canonical record of authorship is `git log`).

Contributors are listed in chronological order of first contribution.
Lines follow the format: Name <email> (alias)

---

Tom Andrieu <andrieutom30@gmail.com> (Seeyko)
Gabriel Desbouis <desbouis.lgabriel@gmail.com> (TarsaaL, gabrieldesbouis)
Nicolas Bataille <63408806+NicolasBataille@users.noreply.github.com>

---

To get listed here, open a pull request adding your name once your first
contribution has been merged. By contributing to MnM, you agree to the
project's Contributor License Agreement (see CLA.md).

For the full list of git authors (including bot accounts and AI tools used
during development), run:

    git log --format='%aN <%aE>' | sort -u
